{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n憑「真人版蛇姬」封號走紅36歲台灣女星林采緹昨日（10月23日）在社交平台公開帛琉度假近況，身穿火辣比堅尼現身知名景點「牛奶湖」。她毫不吝嗇將白色火山泥塗抹全身大騷極致曲線，畫面超衝擊！\n</p>\n<h2>「真人版蛇姬」帛琉牛奶湖養眼福利</h2>\n<p>林采緹換上色彩鮮艷且帶有兩側綁帶設計極少布比堅尼，並將長髮編成利落側邊辮子，以一身清爽造型抵達夢幻無比牛奶湖。面對眼前美景，她徹底放下偶像包袱，將湖底沉澱白色火山泥大方塗抹全身。這身貼身裝扮完美襯托出她豐滿上圍以及纖幼腰線，在陽光照射下火辣曲線盡現人前，將自在愜意度假心情完全表露無遺。</p>\n<h2>發文驚嘆當地美景並詢問功效</h2>\n<p>對於這趟突如其來海島之旅，林采緹難掩興奮之情，第一時間透過社交平台向大眾分享當下感受。她大讚當地風景如畫，直言：「台灣有直飛我竟然現在才去！牛奶湖完全是不用濾鏡的Tiffany綠，湖底沉澱厚厚一層細緻的白色火山泥，聽說可以美容去角質！不知道是真的嗎」。</p>\n<h2>榮升人母依然保持極佳狀態</h2>\n<p>憑藉超乎常人F級上圍及冷艷外表，林采緹早年因Cosplay動漫人物而獲封為「真人版蛇姬」，從此在演藝圈中佔一席位並累積大批忠實粉絲。縱使經歷歲月洗禮並已經榮升為人母，她對自身體態管理依然嚴格，絲毫未見任何走樣跡象。多年來她經常周遊列國並熱愛參與各項水上活動，透過持續運動維持緊緻線條，每次公開亮相總能輕易成為大眾目光焦點。</p>\n<h2>網民：台灣最美的風景！</h2>\n<p>大批網民紛紛直指畫面極具視覺衝擊力，留言表示「這身材真的太誇張」、「完全看不出已經做媽媽」、「女帝出遊！」、「去角質效果看起來很厲害」、「台灣最美的風景！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132282175768_7229259046adc28ac7163c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132282175768_7229259046adc28ac7163c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281322895766136_2432535856adc28ad3df72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281322895766136_2432535856adc28ad3df72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281322981312907_2475524636adc28ae0e93b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281322981312907_2475524636adc28ae0e93b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323056490280_19752979506adc28aecdff4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323056490280_19752979506adc28aecdff4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1792813231350368_17062034096adc28af89cb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1792813231350368_17062034096adc28af89cb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323210657605_20898986436adc28b063624.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323210657605_20898986436adc28b063624.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132329317924_8810542726adc28b12a131.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132329317924_8810542726adc28b12a131.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323362830373_10480218686adc28b1f0552.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323362830373_10480218686adc28b1f0552.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323450046208_3717423636adc28b2bfe39.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323450046208_3717423636adc28b2bfe39.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323696948605_5121266876adc28b53dd1c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281323696948605_5121266876adc28b53dd1c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132390714168_7246822586adc28b75bbbf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928132390714168_7246822586adc28b75bbbf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281324122230520_6721017966adc28b99f479.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"林采緹 牛奶湖 （圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179281324122230520_6721017966adc28b99f479.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：林采緹 Sunny Lin@FB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:04:34.580931+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1163,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:40:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:30.083868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:27.325152+00:00","content_hash":"e744a395811b365447b953970992cbd61005ccaa0db62397bd305f7ad84ae7a5","evidence_s